                <invention-title lang="de">MASSBAND MIT VERSTÄRKTEM BANDBLATT UND/ODER REISSMINDERNDER HAKENKONFIGURATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MÈTRE À RUBAN AVEC UNE LAME DE RUBAN RENFORCÉE ET/OU UNE CONFIGURATION DE CROCHET DE RÉDUCTION DE DÉCHIRURE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TAPE MEASURE WITH REINFORCED TAPE BLADE AND/OR TEAR REDUCING HOOK CONFIGURATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A tape measure (10) comprising a housing (18), a reel rotatably mounted within the housing, an elongate blade (14) comprising an elongate metal, a polymer coating surrounding the elongate metal core, and an ink layer located between the elongate metal core and the polymer coating, a spring coupled to the reel, and a hook (26) assembly coupled to an outer end of the elongate blade. The polymer coating thickness may be greater than the metal thickness. The elongate blade (14) may have a pinch load threshold of greater than 50 lbs.</p>
            </abstract>
